---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Band Saw Blade Supply"
  description="Band Saw Blade Supply helps overseas buyers compare bandsaw blade specifications and request quotations by application, size and cutting material."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</nav>
      <p class="kicker kicker--red">Specification-led supply</p>
      <h1>Manufacturing competence should be visible in the specification.</h1>
      <p>Band Saw Blade Supply communicates through application fit, blade dimensions, tooth form, material control and honest quotation details rather than vague factory claims.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="section section--gray">
      <div class="section__inner proof-grid">
        <article class="proof-card"><h3>Application first</h3><p>Food and bone, wood and metal buyers can start from the cutting job.</p></article>
        <article class="proof-card"><h3>Technical clarity</h3><p>Specifications are organized for comparison, quotation and future repeat orders.</p></article>
        <article class="proof-card"><h3>Quotation before supply</h3><p>Price, lead time and MOQ are confirmed after compatibility and destination are known.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
